}

### CP-01: Client cannot override server-controlled fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "CP01 protected fields test",
  "description": "Checking server-controlled fields",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-11-07T13:28:58Z",
  "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "ownerUserId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "status": "Closed"
}

